/-- Stacks 0A67, 0A8U, and 0A92: the source-order tensor-to-iterated internal-Hom comparison
selected by an explicit closed owner and a fixed-right tensor model.  Here `K` is the fixed right
parameter of the canonical derived tensor functor. -/
@[stacks 0A67, stacks 0A8U, stacks 0A92 "derived tensor-to-iterated internal-Hom comparison"]
