  (compOf_natural_middle H M K g N).w

/-! The unit aliases below deliberately live after `adjunctionOf`: this keeps the adjunction the
primitive owner and makes the component formulas transparent to downstream code. -/

/-- Stacks `0A6B` and `0A8W`: the unit of the fixed-right derived tensor/internal-Hom adjunction
selected by an explicit closed owner and tensor model.  This is the canonical map
